{"b":"Ps","c":51,"v":[{"n":1,"t":"Have mercy upon me, O God, according to thy lovingkindness: according unto the multitude of thy tender mercies blot out my transgressions.","tags":["prayer"],"tm":{"prayer":"Addresses God directly: “O God”."},"x":[["Acts.3.19",46,"r"],["Isa.44.22",36,"w"],["Isa.43.25",33,"w"],["Ps.51.9",29,"w"],["Col.2.14",24,"r"],["Ps.69.16",23,"e"],["2Sam.11.2",18,"r"],["2Sam.12.13",18,"r"],["Eph.1.6",13,"r"],["Eph.1.8",13,"r"]]},{"n":2,"t":"Wash me throughly from mine iniquity, and cleanse me from my sin.","x":[["1John.1.7",13,"w"],["1John.1.9",13,"w"],["Ps.51.7",10,"w"],["Heb.10.21",9,"r"],["Heb.10.22",9,"r"],["Rev.1.5",9,"r"],["Ezek.36.25",8,"w"],["Jer.4.14",8,"w"],["Acts.22.16",6,"w"],["Isa.1.16",6,"w"]]},{"n":3,"t":"For I acknowledge my transgressions: and my sin is ever before me.","it":[[48,50]],"x":[["Isa.59.12",11,"w"],["Prov.28.13",11,"r"],["Ps.38.18",9,"w"],["Ps.32.5",7,"w"],["Luke.15.18",4,"r"],["Luke.15.21",4,"r"],["Lev.26.40",4,"r"],["Lev.26.41",4,"r"],["Jer.3.25",3,"r"],["Ps.40.12",3,"r"]]},{"n":4,"t":"Against thee, thee only, have I sinned, and done this evil in thy sight: that thou mightest be justified when thou speakest, and be clear when thou judgest.","it":[[49,53],[125,128]],"x":[["2Sam.12.13",11,"w"],["2Sam.12.14",11,"r"],["Luke.15.21",9,"w"],["Rom.3.4",6,"w"],["Gen.39.9",6,"r"],["Gen.20.6",6,"r"],["Lev.6.2",4,"r"],["Lev.6.7",4,"r"],["Rev.16.5",4,"r"],["2Kgs.21.6",3,"w"]]},{"n":5,"t":"Behold, I was shapen in iniquity; and in sin did my mother conceive me.","x":[["Rom.5.12",24,"w"],["Job.14.4",20,"r"],["Ps.58.3",20,"r"],["Job.15.14",18,"r"],["Job.15.16",18,"w"],["Eph.2.3",17,"r"],["John.3.6",15,"r"],["Gen.5.3",12,"r"],["Gen.8.21",8,"r"]]},{"n":6,"t":"Behold, thou desirest truth in the inward parts: and in the hidden part thou shalt make me to know wisdom.","it":[[67,71]],"x":[["1Sam.16.7",21,"r"],["Ps.15.2",21,"w"],["Job.38.36",14,"w"],["1Pet.3.4",14,"w"],["Rom.7.22",13,"w"],["Prov.2.6",13,"w"],["Luke.11.39",11,"w"],["Jas.4.8